        "insight_type": "observation",
        "position_hint": 0.35,
        "text": "Liam Verbeek, thanks for being here."
      },
      "type": "Insight"
    },
    {
      "id": "insight:f247d55c98c9b199",
      "properties": {
        "episode_id": "5b39965f-22a2-54c9-9c42-e7a19d8da2da",
        "grounded": true,
        "insight_type": "recommendation",
        "position_hint": 0.5,
        "text": "Excited for this one \u2014 trail building is something I've been thinking about a lot."
      },
      "type": "Insight"
    },
    {
      "id": "person:speaker-02",
      "properties": {
        "name": "Liam Verbeek"
      },
      "type": "Person"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:e42afbb2b70c2fa9",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 306,
        "char_start": 210,
        "episode_id": "5b39965f-22a2-54c9-9c42-e7a19d8da2da",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Thanks, Maya. Excited for this one \u2014 trail building is something I've been thinking about a lot.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 12000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 6000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p01_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "person:speaker-01",
      "properties": {
        "name": "Maya"
      },
      "type": "Person"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:c8a90ec803536ffa",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 422,
        "char_start": 313,
        "episode_id": "5b39965f-22a2-54c9-9c42-e7a19d8da2da",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "This episode is brought to you by Strava. Strava is the home for athletes. Get started at strava.com/podcast.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 18000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 12000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p01_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:95c2a2689c6a67db",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 492,
        "char_start": 422,
        "episode_id": "5b39965f-22a2-54c9-9c42-e7a19d8da2da",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "Take me through the decision. How does RockShox fit into this picture?",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 24000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 18000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p01_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:2e69c860aa39a191",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 704,
        "char_start": 507,
        "episode_id": "5b39965f-22a2-54c9-9c42-e7a19d8da2da",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Honestly, Drainage is the single highest-leverage design choice on any trail. We've seen this play out at teams using Cascadia Alliance. I've watched this pattern hold across three different teams.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 30000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 24000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p01_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:6d3f2a45906126aa",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 798,
        "char_start": 711,
        "episode_id": "5b39965f-22a2-54c9-9c42-e7a19d8da2da",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "Take me through the decision. What's the version of the question that actually matters?",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 36000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 30000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p01_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:b5fcbb60cd0a8fcc",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 959,
        "char_start": 813,
        "episode_id": "5b39965f-22a2-54c9-9c42-e7a19d8da2da",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Yeah, so \u2014 The most common mistake new builders make is grading too aggressively. Once you internalize that, the rest of the decisions get easier.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 42000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 36000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p01_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    }
